;
; dungeon_b.tres — Deep dungeon variant B.
; L-shaped chamber with side alcove, copper and iron ore veins, torches on pillar.
; Palette: stone/cobblestone natural, copper_ore/iron_ore natural.
; Contains bronze chest in alcove corner.
; DOCS.md §2 — dungeon structure; CONTEXT.md D-08 (rare, deep underground).
; allowed_biomes = [] means any biome — placement gated by depth in structure_placer.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/bricks/brick_template.gd" id="1_btmpl"]

